=== Northern savanna ===

The far northern portion of Burawa, in the [[Dimar]] region, extends beyond the mountain range into the {{w|tropical savanna}} zone. This area is sparsely populated compared to the south and experiences a {{w|tropical savanna climate}} with distinct wet and dry seasons.

== Hydrography ==

=== Rivers ===

Burawa is drained by several major river systems, all of which ultimately flow to the [[Mesogean Sea]]. The [[Great Kaftian Mountain Range]] serves as the primary {{w|drainage divide|watershed divide}}, with rivers north of the range draining toward the [[Great Kaftian Lake]] and the [[Aethiopian Ocean]].

