== Environmental issues ==

=== Deforestation ===

Historical {{w|deforestation}} has affected the [[Central Burawa]] and [[Buran River Valley]] regions, where highland forests were cleared for agriculture and timber. {{w|Reforestation}} programmes have been implemented since the mid-20th century.

=== Coastal development ===

The [[Mesogean Sea|Mesogean]] coastline, particularly in the [[Iskhal Megalopolis]] and [[Kankadadka-Samara Megalopolis]] regions, has experienced significant development pressure. Coastal {{w|wetland}}s and {{w|estuary|estuarine}} habitats have been reduced by {{w|urbanisation}} and port construction.

=== Hydrocarbon extraction ===

Offshore petroleum and natural gas extraction in the [[Central Coast]] region has raised environmental concerns regarding {{w|marine ecosystem}}s and the risk of {{w|oil spill}}s.

